stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> pending: enqueue
    pending --> running: claim, FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED
    running --> done: work and status commit in ONE transaction
    running --> pending: error with attempts left
    running --> failed: attempts exhausted
    running --> pending: lease expired, worker crashed
    failed --> pending: retry-failed
    pending --> missing: input file absent
    missing --> pending: file arrives
